# Test assets ship in the sdist only — `pip download html-golive && pytest`
# works from the archive alone. They must NOT reach the wheel: the wheel is
# the runtime surface, an install should not carry its own audit fixtures,
# and data-files entries land in .data/data/ where nothing sane imports them
# from (external audit of 0.9.3: 52 test assets inside the wheel violated the
# runtime-only promise). MANIFEST.in feeds the sdist, never the wheel.
include tests/__init__.py
recursive-include tests *.py
recursive-include tests/corpus *.html *.md
